---
import '@fontsource/sora/400.css';
import '@fontsource/sora/600.css';
import '../../styles/website-audit.css';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/><title>Website Audit | NC Digital Admin</title></head><body>
<header class="topbar"><a href="/admin/links/" class="brand">NC <span>Digital</span><small>/ Website Audit</small></a><nav><a href="/admin/keyword-research/">Keyword research</a><a href="/admin/links/">All tools ↗</a></nav></header>
<main><section class="intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">WEBSITE AUDIT & SALES REPORT</p><h1>See what needs work.<br/><span>Show what you can improve.</span></h1><p>A focused website check with page-level evidence and a branded report you can take to your next client conversation.</p></div><div class="cost"><strong>£0</strong><span>DataForSEO spend<br/>uses public website checks</span></div></section>
<section class="panel start"><form id="audit-form"><fieldset id="audit-fields"><div class="form-grid"><label>Website address<input id="website" required maxlength="500" placeholder="https://example.co.uk" autocomplete="url"/></label><label>Client / business name<input id="client" maxlength="120" placeholder="Optional"/></label><label>Audit size<select id="page-limit"><option value="10">Up to 10 pages</option><option value="5">Quick check · 5 pages</option></select></label><button class="primary" id="start" type="submit" disabled>Audit website ↗</button></div><div class="form-foot"><p>Checks key pages and up to 20 further internal links. Saved reports are reused for 7 days.</p><label class="checkbox"><input id="refresh" type="checkbox"/> Run a fresh audit</label></div></fieldset></form></section>
<div class="history"><label for="history">Saved audits</label><select id="history"><option value="">Choose a report…</option></select><button id="open-report">Open report</button></div>
<div id="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
<section id="progress" class="panel progress" hidden><div><p class="eyebrow">AUDIT PROGRESS</p><h2 id="phase"></h2><p id="progress-copy"></p></div><div class="actions"><button id="resume" hidden>Resume audit</button><button id="stop">Stop audit</button></div></section>
<section id="empty" class="empty"><div class="empty-mark">↗</div><h2>Useful evidence for a better sales conversation.</h2><div class="features"><div><span>01</span><h3>Check the foundations</h3><p>Find missing SEO essentials, mobile setup issues and broken internal links.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>Explain the opportunity</h3><p>See what was found, why it matters and a practical fix for each finding.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>Make it client-ready</h3><p>Add your recommendations and save an NC Digital report as a PDF or standalone document.</p></div></div></section>
<section id="results" hidden>
<div class="report-tools"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR AUDIT</p><h2 id="report-title"></h2></div><div class="actions"><button id="download">Download report</button><button class="primary" id="print">Print / save PDF</button></div></div>
<details class="panel editor" id="editor"><summary>Personalise the client report</summary><form id="notes-form"><label>Client / business name<input id="report-client" maxlength="120" required/></label><label>Your introduction<textarea id="summary" maxlength="4000" rows="3" placeholder="What matters most for this business?"></textarea></label><label>Recommended work / next steps<textarea id="notes" maxlength="6000" rows="5" placeholder="Add your proposed scope, priorities and next step for the client."></textarea></label><button type="submit">Save report notes</button><span id="notes-status" role="status"></span></form></details>
<div id="report-document"></div>
</section>
</main><script>import '../../scripts/website-audit.js';</script></body></html>
